        "original_id": "5ef7a806-17f7-5806-aeae-6b0bc5ac32e8",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Episodes: Episode 8, May the Giant Be with You\n- Television Series: Twin Peaks, Stargate SG-1\n- People: Don S. Davis, Don Sinclair Davis\n- Roles: General Hammond, Major Garland Briggs\n\nFacts:\n- \"Episode 8,\" also known as \"May the Giant Be with You,\" is the first episode of the second season of the American mystery television series \"Twin Peaks.\"\n- Don Sinclair Davis was born on August 4, 1942, and was an American character actor.\n- Don S. Davis played Major Garland Briggs on the television series \"Twin Peaks\" from 1990 to 1991.\n- Don S. Davis played General Hammond on the television series \"Stargate SG-1\" from 1997 to 2007.\n- Don S. Davis died on June 29, 2008.",
